Package: floraveg
Title: Indicadores Ecológicos y De Vegetación
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Paul E.", "Santos Andrade", , 
           "paulefrens@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: Automated processing, structural analysis, and ecological assessment of floristic and vegetation inventory data. Converts raw field observations into standardized community matrices for estimating alpha, beta, and gamma diversity metrics, species accumulation curves, and rarefaction profiles using 'vegan' and 'iNEXT'. Computes structural attributes including basal area, diametric and altitudinal class distributions, natural regeneration stages, and species Importance Value Index ('IVI'). Calculates Above-Ground Biomass ('AGB') for tropical forests using allometric models by Chave et al. (2014) <doi:10.1111/gcb.12629> paired with a curated reference database of neotropical wood densities, timber volume estimations, and equivalent carbon stock assessments. Includes an interactive modular web dashboard built with 'shiny', 'bslib', and 'ggplot2' for reactive data exploration, custom visualization, and reproducible report generation.
